        "content_hash": "a03c51e4a9dc97d62e97c68fad4f4bf51c7f6e8a9e740300d3cba9c04d9a0c4c"
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E3",
      "text": "As at the end of March 2026 the capital adequacy ratio is 16 percent, gross non-performing assets are 1.4 percent of total assets, and the liquidity coverage ratio is about 125 percent.",
