      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E4",
      "text": "The chief executive, in post since 2018, has had his term extended to October 2028. Under him the bank worked through elevated non-performing assets and earlier governance concerns and refocused on growth calibrated for risk.",
      "source": {
        "source_id": "S4",
        "source_type": "DECLARATION",
        "title": "Investment manager's case-study note (management)",
        "collected_at": "2026-11-10T10:00:00Z",
